ions in the practice',NULL,41,1,'2014-06-26 11:14:35',NULL),(42,37,10,1,'Have workforce members been trained on these policies and procedures',NULL,42,1,'2014-06-26 11:14:37',NULL),(43,NULL,11,1,'Is there a risk that the practice will not have nor implement consistent policies for granting access to ePHI to the practice workforce',NULL,43,1,'2014-06-26 11:16:12',NULL),(44,43,11,1,'Are there policies and procedures for defining what ePHI to which workers should have access through workstations, transactions, programs, etc',NULL,44,1,'2014-06-26 11:16:13',NULL),(45,43,11,1,'Are there policies and procedures for giving workforce members access to only the ePHI to which they are authorized',NULL,45,1,'2014-06-26 11:16:13',NULL),(46,43,11,1,'Have workforce members been trained on these policies and procedures',NULL,46,1,'2014-06-26 11:16:14',NULL),(47,43,11,1,'Are those policies and procedures being followed',NULL,47,1,'2014-06-26 11:16:16',NULL),(48,NULL,13,1,'Is there a risk that staff can be become sloppy in their security processes',NULL,48,1,'2014-06-26 11:17:32',NULL),(49,47,13,1,'Is there a policy and procedures for maintaining staff awareness of the practices security policies',NULL,49,1,'2014-06-26 11:17:33',NULL),(50,47,13,1,'Have workforce members been trained on these policies and procedures',NULL,50,1,'2014-06-26 11:17:34',NULL),(51,47,13,1,'Is there a schedule for conducting refresher training',NULL,51,1,'2014-06-26 11:17:35',NULL),(52,NULL,14,1,'Is the practice at risk that malicious software can be introduced to the practice\'s servers, workstations or other devices',NULL,52,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:24',NULL),(53,52,14,1,'Has there been an incident when malicious software has been introduced to the practices server, workstation or other devices',NULL,53,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:41',NULL),(54,52,14,1,'Are there policies and procedures for defining the process for protecting the practice\'s systems from malicious software',NULL,54,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:42',NULL),(55,52,14,1,'If there was an incident of malicious software being introduced was it easily and effectively handled',NULL,55,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:43',NULL),(56,52,14,1,'Are there policies and procedures to ensure that malicious software is not introduced to the practice\'s computers',NULL,56,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:44',NULL),(57,52,14,1,'Are those policies and procedures followed',NULL,57,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:45',NULL),(58,52,14,1,'Is protective software installed on the practice\'s server',NULL,58,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:45',NULL),(59,52,14,1,'Is protective software installed on the practice\'s workstations',NULL,59,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:46',NULL),(60,52,14,1,'Is protective software installed on the practice\'s other devices - laptop, palm, cell phones, thumb drives, ipads, etc',NULL,60,1,'2014-06-26 11:19:47',NULL),(61,NULL,15,1,'Is there a risk of unauthorized individuals trying to log into the practice\'s computers and the attempts not being known by the practice management',NULL,61,1,'2014-06-26 11:20:37',NULL),(62,61,15,1,'Have there been attempts by unauthorized individuals to log into the practice\'s computers and the attempts not being identified',NULL,62,1,'2014-06-26 11:20:47',NULL),(63,61,15,1,'Are there policies and procedures for defining the process for monitoring use log-in attempts',NULL,63,1,'2014-06-26 11:20:49',NULL),(64,61,15,1,'Is there software installed on the practice\'s computers that allows for the capture of log-in attempts and identification of discrepancies',NULL,64,1,'2014-06-26 11:20:50',NULL),(65,61,15,1,'Does the installed software provide reports of log-in discrepancies',NULL,65,1,'2014-06-26 11:20:52',NULL),(66,NULL,16,1,'Is there a risk of unauthorized individuals inappropriately using a workforce member\'s password',NULL,66,1,'2014-06-26 11:22:05',NULL),(67,66,16,1,'Has there been an incident of an individual\'s password being used by an unauthorized individual to access ePHI',NULL,67,1,'2014-06-26 11:22:13',NULL),(68,66,16,1,'Are passwords shared