te in an emergency mode because of an interruption of business operations',NULL,94,1,'2014-06-26 11:29:00',NULL),(95,94,20,1,'Has there been an incident that required the practice to operate in an emergency mode',NULL,95,1,'2014-06-26 11:29:12',NULL),(96,94,20,1,'Is there a realistic possibility of fire, flood, earthquake, tornado or other disaster that can cause the practice to have to operate in an emergency mode',NULL,96,1,'2014-06-26 11:29:13',NULL),(97,94,20,1,'Does the practice have a disaster recovery plan that includes emergency notification of practice workers and patients',NULL,97,1,'2014-06-26 11:29:14',NULL),(98,94,20,1,'Does the Disaster Recovery Plan include procedures for making a smooth and continuous recovery to normal operations should emergency operations be required',NULL,98,1,'2014-06-26 11:29:15',NULL),(99,NULL,21,1,'Is there a risk that the contingency plans are developed but not be able to be reasonably made operational should a disaster occur',NULL,99,1,'2014-06-26 11:30:57',NULL),(100,99,21,1,'Has there been an occasion when a disaster plan has had to be enacted and was ineffective',NULL,100,1,'2014-06-26 11:31:25',NULL),(101,99,21,1,'Has the Disaster Recovery Plan been tested so that the practice knows what to do in the event of an interruption to normal operating procedures',NULL,101,1,'2014-06-26 11:31:27',NULL),(102,99,21,1,'Has the Disaster Recovery Plan been updated to reflect changes in practice business operations, changes in software, telephone technology or computer hardware',NULL,102,1,'2014-06-26 11:31:27',NULL),(103,99,21,1,'If there was a disaster, is the practice confident that a recovery could be implemented so that there would be minimal impact on practice operations and health care services',NULL,103,1,'2014-06-26 11:31:29',NULL),(104,NULL,22,1,'Is there a risk that a disaster may occur and the recovery plan be implemented and critical data not be available to support the practice',NULL,104,1,'2014-06-26 11:31:59',NULL),(1