rict access to the practice\'s facility for access to the software programs and/or data been implemented and tested',NULL,128,1,'2014-06-26 11:37:38',NULL),(129,125,26,1,'Have workforce members been trained on these policies and procedures',NULL,129,1,'2014-06-26 11:37:40',NULL),(130,NULL,27,1,'Is there a risk that changes may be made to the facility security resources and not documented or communicated to the appropriate individuals',NULL,130,1,'2014-06-26 11:38:34',NULL),(131,130,27,1,'Are there policies and procedures describing facility physical security',NULL,131,1,'2014-06-26 11:38:41',NULL),(132,130,27,1,'Have there been changes to the physical security resources that are not documented',NULL,132,1,'2014-06-26 11:38:42',NULL),(133,130,27,1,'Are there policies and procedures describing how facility security changes are to be made and documented',NULL,133,1,'2014-06-26 11:38:42',NULL),(134,130,27,1,'Are those policies and procedures followed',NULL,134,1,'2014-06-26 11:38:44',NULL),(135,NULL,28,1,'Is there a risk that workstations, and other computer equipment and devices, can be used for functions for which they were not intended',NULL,135,1,'2014-06-26 11:39:37',NULL),(136,135,28,1,'Are there workstations and other devices that are used for more than just accessing patient health information',NULL,136,1,'2014-06-26 11:39:44',NULL),(137,135,28,1,'Does the practice have policies and procedures that define what functions are to be performed on specific workstations and/or other devices',NULL,137,1,'2014-06-26 11:39:45',NULL),(138,135,28,1,'Are workstations and other devices set up to do only those functions as defined in the policies and procedures',NULL,138,1,'2014-06-26 11:39:46',NULL),(139,135,28,1,'Is the ability to make changes to the functions that can be performed on a workstation or other devices allocated and secured to applicable individuals',NULL,139,1,'2014-06-26 11:39:47',NULL),(140,NULL,29,1,'Is there a risk that unauthorized individuals can have ph