ice know how to mitigate the impact of a breach should a breach occur',NULL,506,1,'2014-07-01 13:11:56',NULL),(507,496,84,2,'Does the practice have a process for tracking breaches',NULL,507,1,'2014-07-01 13:12:56',NULL),(508,496,84,2,'Does the practice know what \"secured information\" is as defined by the HIPAA regulations section §164.402',NULL,508,1,'2014-07-01 13:12:56',NULL),(509,496,84,2,'Does the practice know how to avoid a breach',NULL,509,1,'2014-07-01 13:12:57',NULL),(510,496,84,2,'Are all electronic files on all computers and storage devices encrypted with unique decryption keys',NULL,510,1,'2014-07-01 13:12:57',NULL),(511,496,84,2,'Are providers, management and staff trained on how to secure patient health information',NULL,511,1,'2014-07-01 13:12:57',NULL),(512,496,84,2,'Does the practice allow patient health records to be taken from the practice facility',NULL,512,1,'2014-07-01 13:13:00',NULL),(513,NULL,85,2,'Is the practice able to maximize its revenue in the future by qualifying for full Medicare and Medicaid payments.',NULL,513,1,'2014-07-01 13:14:02',NULL),(514,513,85,2,'Does the practice bill Medicare and Medicaid for patient services',NULL,514,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:26',NULL),(515,513,85,2,'Do the providers perform 90% or more of their services in an inpatient or emergency room setting',NULL,515,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:26',NULL),(516,513,85,2,'Are at least 30% of the practice\'s health care services provided in an outpatient setting (20% for pediatricians)',NULL,516,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:27',NULL),(517,513,85,2,'Is the practice predominantly an FQHC or RHC with 30% patients classified as \"needy\"',NULL,517,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:27',NULL),(518,513,85,2,'Does the practice bill Medicare using the Medicare physician schedule',NULL,518,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:28',NULL),(519,513,85,2,'Is the practice aware of the potential earnings available for qualifying for the \"meaningful use\" of a certified EMR system',NULL,519,1,'2014-07-01 13:20:29',NULL),(520,513,85,2,'Do